1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,440
A target number appears...

2
00:00:01,440 --> 00:00:05,000
and a handful of numbers to reach it!

3
00:00:05,660 --> 00:00:07,380
This is Target Number!

4
00:00:08,640 --> 00:00:11,540
Tap two numbers and an operator to combine them!

5
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:13,880
Target twenty-six...

6
00:00:14,400 --> 00:00:16,860
four times six is twenty-four!

7
00:00:18,100 --> 00:00:19,720
Twenty-four plus two...

8
00:00:20,260 --> 00:00:23,900
that's twenty-six — target reached!

9
00:00:25,720 --> 00:00:30,800
Combine until only one number is left — can you always hit the target?

10
00:00:32,440 --> 00:00:38,420
Parents — this builds flexible thinking, so kids try different paths to the same answer!

11
00:00:39,900 --> 00:00:41,200
Think you can hit it?

12
00:00:42,300 --> 00:00:48,180
Tap Math Game Zone, line up Target Number, pick your level, and take your shot!

